  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "歷山之下，虞唐所處。躬耕致孝，名聞四海。為堯所薦，禪位天子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b62431c2456fc469d674bc31bbcfb32a42ba31ee11eb2335775f2e47a7c6307",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0c7299b155cf4e9cdf025fff7c823a56dd027e0184d00fc82c34f6680dc793d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "蜎飛蠕動，各有所配。歡悅相迎，咸得其處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb005caefb66a0bd4ba78904750e6475b3806bcc5c6631aa6541bda660baf074",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:309703b2d066302401e73512c729916896683eaace40ec5e7f986da494413833"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "繼祀宗邑，追明成康。光照萬國，享世久長。病疾不醫，下即蒿蘆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3e0e99870e910b202d634fdf5630d5fbba71f9fdfa47efc70cfdbe9d648c4237",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c53d3f5acd2bcb46e9d82a651d06a27b713e4ad7fd4fb5794fadf7349654ed49"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "秋冬探巢，不得鵲雛。銜指北去，媿我少姬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc48b46a696bc7e2ff3f179ad9f0f9b116f5e0f3f2f9784defe5036644486a9a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1b772b5cb3339ce6c38ec9015bbc544a0610f541aa7017fc41b5495b60e98f81"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "僮妾獨宿，長女未室，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c0dd604b80dacba1cbda54918e065885a3314d79456757c3ca1159b734ab6b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c4c99e836d65d4af4c02f12eb3f76dbf936f49584a0fca8077429e17c41352f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "洪魚逆流，至人潛去。蒿蓬代柱，大屋顛仆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad63fbd69ea76d0ca400ed06865bc267080f27d43c08a2e1cea41f6a18721f0a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5eff0786e7a58af4ac33ccb64fa64e32ddf461cd8c0a86c14b339198cc8c02b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "日闇不明，讒夫在堂。右臂疾痹，君失其光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:427b14e7dab567ed10f767127c905d504fcaf279276c979f9285787543fb0aa8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:efbf0bacc7a1d66cedb017571d55afe8d00725142fa089714aabd68c7180de7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "王孫季子，相與孝友。明允篤誠，升擢薦舉。為國榦柱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee43aa65761ba63bd52a21c9c2dcdfa50361a7a2f16360e3db9ca87efd083b08",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b28bb0ef20d93ed6ec29e15abce8c53954e367674619553ba08d48bd8a38c815"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "麟趾龍身，日馭三千。南上蒼梧，與福為婚。道里夷易，安全無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f9c298133759c8bd4a8ecfaa2529698af686b3c97dfc4ee4eb7aa7b4051b05f6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f1464fb878c8aabe34580ba7dfa0e7a3e3b4cdfac60a90f2515b8e7d83dfedde"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "三子成駒，折損轅軸。輪載空輿，後時失期。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d9f31ee1645cefc2dfe72c9ff69e2713129c22ee506bef9c413026880c27f9d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c3afd3a52972abf0ba03ce3c20aa12b89716066d298ac8c16219cdda01804ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "逐福除患，道德神仙。避惡萬里，常歡以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e7ef0e6320d676dd8362fef189dddcbd800725eb7448553bf424f9ab23722c5e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a3596cc43b539d8e34973c7162dec7b897819ad2b77a1269243a3e6c60a0c73"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "黃池之盟，吳楚爭強。勾踐為患，夷門不安。探 得螽，所願不喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5102542dcae6eeac9798b611e07d62894b832f8b8633654b6d38f7338fbb448d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8f8ae371766bc9d3a6592a8f05c2495dcda4fd4eae8b9a5f39263003a8930b2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "青牛白咽，呼我俱田。歷山之下，可以多耕。歲藏時節，人保安寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b1bdca3e93a5c94b47b5ebc81ef8be9cae7ec3422c4a406d32987fdc962b2a14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e63d3831c3061a1601d04196400fefea41df2a5ed5375eea59b26141cfd512f5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "有頭無目，赫赫粟粟。一作不見菽粟）消耗為疾，三年不復。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1d97b0b390f58ff9b75371ca5634c24521b53b2359263f3de0c98e2aacfff60a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:efc70f5268ae252faa9b605a752f632ae0981eec03535071691334ae4ddc9b8b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "山沒丘浮，陸為水魚。燕雀無巢，民無室廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d96cbd857423cfa5534450ed6245b68e7ccc086cd27abb6cf9cebb0f673f49c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d824417fe8e5997eded01fd5446b4ba4a270f9b81cb09ea8b0529ef509aeb6e2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "高岡鳳凰，朝陽梧桐。雝雝喈喈，奉奉萋萋。陳辭不多，以告孔嘉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:495cbc798aa2a08566ca7fc52c10edfc716b2bdecf2c96e41898d927b6d8f150",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd3a86942e4f137da931d26c1d211d989cd92478ca052e6550c522433b785f73"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "鰥寡獨宿，憂動胸臆，莫與笑食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6dcf5fe3736d82537a41c2b0f3ce3928a24dcc01874db9bb09933fa64b961c01",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c697fd5128ae5f2c70780c3261deefb5f54fde40beb3f45f2f4d125d47597f76"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "躓馬破車，惡婦破家。青蠅汙白，暴子離居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b6a758955b9877ac19d56e006e6d14369658c4ea53f066910dfb4edae9254a7f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f719dfb2ff1a8336e193ff3142df513678edfc0c00abcbd41a6380ef85bc0dda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "長女二嫁，進退無羞。逐狐作妖，行者離憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:679f0c6fd242f61b80a0a7cb5574d13e53a99ac4e04b30f635a75fa0e20b0d1a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e79ea18b7b85c3d4f147de0dadb9eefa8b41d20d0db39fdf024c0d54c9d527fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "人無足法，緩行長姦。地雄走歸，陽不制陰。男失其家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1935dcdd9c9fd261fcb2cf425a5bbff53a063c7216ccf058600b20ac322bdaed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:edc5328ae5db5fec050d63999e6841d99ff3681568e0e8a0b7381c09ff4467ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "茹芝餌黃，飲食玉英。與神流通，長無憂凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d584162b8b6574f23a5dc383011faa5ea443bb75051c7e81be27469a480e8c4f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f6c05f2759c82df82b976b872dc9f47beedee2b6c0d34be5f478ff1eb9828f29"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "東行無門，西出華山。道塞於難，遊子為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:969e6410e0cd3b5a842b53f8580e0bfe0960bd8b1178199d523bf45b96b5640e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66baff14694aaddbd26627717bbb327c7ec28cb02a74a1bccbc85ffc16e1d917"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "壽如松喬，與日月俱。常安康樂，不罹禍憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94647df707bab1e41f064eff1e1518af76f68211d219fedd8fd025a9ff2b9857",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fcf70375f5ad6114a63bdc036f5817635287aaad8c62a338d1b3d75881733158"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "探 得螽，所願不喜。黃池之盟，吳楚爭強。勾踐為患，夷門不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:08ec95e19e92002f1ca044bd48a2ac3de10676ad30c0f5bbbd88e3b44f8b26d8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cfe8f6b36ce4664cd2693633e0216317eba98dee5dfb41fc9cd2591ab1593c58"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "蝠螺生子，深目黑醜。雖飾相就，眾人莫取。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c770f03e1d0764a43b0cd49a264d51a170de801abfbde2bbd92b5ad34a03126",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cf4f04cd101123ba55a2c7e31f331854b6471af27d094db6761d56f0053a3f2b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "喜怒不時，霜雪為災。稼穡無功，后稷飢寒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1360660ce059fdecda70a76eef30d969c668789c78bbf0dead603920b9ff836e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4485d9596a53a7b144469c427b0248a7754388c86e37dbff5e872f4610c45e7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "烏升鵲舉，照臨東海。尨降庭堅，為陶叔後。封為蓼丘，履祿綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cea74ddd9863f3bba7f993899db90ac29a4e915b7c8f28c5fb592e09ac6a0140",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:737f78eadc0fcec7ffd9f8bbadeb6a5798fd7a7abf95003730bdae4408d51b97"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "黃離白日，照我四國。元首昭明，民賴其福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2cbde3645eaac86ef67d09efefabd0ec102557955e4288ea5a1e63ee56208d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4681f6b6d54f5e5f75c3439f2bfb6554ace21930e8642a81f8e508cc5e3388af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "黍稷醇醲，敬奉山宗。神嗜飲食，甘雨嘉降。獨蒙福力，時災不至。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e927d7f430b5b1a7030b345ba54cd33485e6d9e73293db0bf8428667f18b386a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f1565d27a961c3af10aac6d235d2d2f9efc581c3bf19d3b06217f2515d77a3c6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "禍不更生，福過我里。入門笑喜，與吾利市。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e4eb385a91900a9afc069dfc41893769976581f1e67829acfc72c2e9a7d44348",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a40d722445a56a83e572654355b2c2e99d4c23d9442b0855e1f774adaf07325c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "晝臥牢門，怵惕不安。目不得闔，鬼搔我足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb613cdbe48fc2bc1d424c78b0898c5744711ec1f0180f64ac957aa695771fec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a2f465a7e95da8a7c6a174cac32358188a52843fa91903f88d96be3d27cf9726"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "春草榮華，長女宜夫。受福多年，世有封祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:207a7e402cc8552a917ebc946b7a94a18eee1b92d3d20339e490f22f3db61387",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e1c5e902d665777bb02c690295868bb33319c2da381af10f1955e2a5497a4ee4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "雍門內崩，賊賢傷仁。暴亂狂悖，簡公失位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c0dcc7f31891c89ac2db672f781474669067ff7b726cf1e62c03ba455f70a3aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2fc8d584bad8d3b7e90a4601768fc716cea56f28770b6047bf85d74da8dd8a94"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "心壯無良，猖獗妄行。觸抵牆壁，不見戶房。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54a587c4450f5165ef457870e850ffdb08a7300d0bb61cc10a9561db7dc77649",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c89749ea54716013a69698c81cfe49d7778c9414b39304b8fa5c2dafe83b8ca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "膠車木馬，不利遠賈。出門為患，安止不危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e2f2828433de651d4168aad5ba070cf4e4b855b48d418ca4d6882fad099dbd7d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5dfef8df00a116dc48d7c8a7f646218a86128872660217bd4a8a93eaa666d9dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "家在海隅，橈短流深。企立望宋，無木以趨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d21ec029d11b1c55412de1e5cbaa790bcc3c394aa777f1743441a2abad9bd6bb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6f9ded252db2a30cbeb545618d9b07fc51308f54c3aa43f5d8e8555007863192"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "冬桑枯槁，當風失道。蒙被塵埃，左右勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f126807a3d6ace8c6985f582f992a148f32d9b93ed7f2e33a281389e6c748076",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:44780fce9109137b3f9cceac8ac827f811bf95152a3a901941a49fe0433cc394"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "過時不行，妄逐王公。老女無夫，不安其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:14dd903355272e89d309ce2c236774edfe9de731f8ad1e0fc186dcf412b187f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6089bffbea5864c065a17440373320bc4ed56e26a3c71c4fb6ded39f4a5ddd37"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "履泥污足，名困身辱。兩仇相當，自為痛疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:220ad678a4c2a9f38e5b20ae5dc0b959a00a0e4fab57889f6eded51453bd177c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:467f83a99b6ba07fe6d3ddfecf5573bc606336ab34fcf7442f4d3fffc9cc7f06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "精華墮落，形客醜惡。齟齬挫頓，枯槁腐蠹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd2e4be1ce393b3c825f704ab20eaaf7835c1bea9ce782285d2d25182fbcd73c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:344b82f9308376afb151dae74bf37c8c90462fab4e1a48f27f57f0f3a23a2342"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "長生無極，子孫千億。松柏為梁，堅固不傾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1753d2b18ad3ca0f19769a548e9008b4fa245baf3fd903092d92cd90b9fb7c5f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca96739496cd8f05dfd7d2c3f7e75a90d5f22f666521d4b69fff252c23b8e71d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "去辛就蓼，毒愈酷甚。避井入坎，憂患日生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:794400a13b6f947c0b16c7bd52e3ea67354360ce947cdc008c07e0e7a4ad8327",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e9b2c0c07296f4355f7573f0a2c6b688d0510f40137ee0db38028af38d81c8d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "行堯欽德，養賢致禮。眾英積聚，國無寇賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f231760549bc8c9e3b63a49d3eaaf3a4a952fe2dc22dfb063b11358efe1b7ab1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8015b90853750853516ff89c4cd669546558997530075141be4ab334dd4a3001"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "狗逐兔走，俱入谷口。與虎逢之，迫不得去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6edbfc78dfc8f39dfca6a45624822c71df6085b8a92b7d6d3bbbf11077df152f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:da0adde0055ce58731a3e8e0ed548f517704ce0fd9cf882b207c34f642398185"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "望尚阿衡，太宰周公。藩屏湯武，立為侯王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e617b6717c1c4a82c58df85460ffb2edc6f276a3d8485b179c459ed343a8574d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d6f2a131dfbc39b7e44114418e5363668bb2fdb84d06baa8046b48468849f3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "清人高子，久屯外野。逍遙不歸，思我慈母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1d7a05a360d2c653194ac427b0965a7d671a0fc05d1e684929f157e6161447ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca87c900bee02ae912b172fa31b4a17ab20a163343be4491ad7b47e5135d8c48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "三蟲作蠱，削跡無與。勝母盜泉，居不安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a609035f2adef36be09c078d221878e4386f7db029e01a016ae255b35ff77cc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:429413c06a2de29db65003ccb93897613a0ba455d62f89c0d4f683a6bbc6e46c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "獹作龍身，進無所前。三日五夜，得其所欽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e975957cee3b708e5ade8d326679b83a55110766287d9630a0ad60a351a33a6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b490208526ab1c2088f671848cbd877c52f3175cfd3fc6045029e6b2491bf0a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "黃裡綠衣，君服不宜。淫湎毀常，失其寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0be529de5622d580d2ef9d332bee36a87d9a444d4d823d77fd64f8de71396086",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e00339f8ac62ef82e3e3f604bb852c0676fb95b7f16a0565c923187c00386e89"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "天所顧祐，禍災不到，安吉無懼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c1e9a0763d79ca11650f72ccdbe65cead4db793946f9c8699b3204d1ec4b10de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c7e4f7772010adb92045ea695815ea3a4b207a9bd96e3630b42ff5d85945078f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "盤紆九回，行道留難。止須千丘，乃睹所歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f14871cee25e3063a14e122a33a2321d541d2fa0b56d0843a5dfe29ee16f96b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:579bc4c29b1fb4f00a91dceb10ec621d1fa7a010865ce72e058082cc996a3b21"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "暴虐失國，為下所逐。北奔陰胡，主君旄頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd97e5a0953832d7d905887d4547401b80934bc2068bf306f63442a74b011ee3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d76ca9acf32bcd54552801fc8156f539e45228735b2dd69eb4d0d3edfdff6a2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "御騂從龍，至霍華東。與禹相逢，送至子邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c419d02dcef409751930fc95f2b2cc4555fd7dfbc58d007485eebb073ca99f75",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:806cef864033d884dc1024acaa675e28ca3177ff310abd502a3ef5856d0a32ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "銅人鐵距，雨露勞苦。終日卒歲，無有休息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a166a6b908e4bb130790beccf877afb3c9527480e83b1d93b5d2f0cf5d2f001a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:779665e8b8e7f53d2418662c8ae1aae4ad2430c4f55ce21d7aa65321d97e37c5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "大人失宜，盈滿復虧。成長之木，盛者滅衰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:840e599ddabbfed9575a9e9f54c679d4a2a19386eff4b36234b5c0cb713bba67",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7fc761c482cf81245e8b00b3ae67f982f1cf51bacf8a3868bde8deb9246b3b62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "梅李冬實，國多盜賊。亂擾並作，王不能制。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cc667bae0efd882903d1df2625156100d7d4c8bc14e33ddd9e770189f96a4388",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6c8c680bf19b5bdd48769025a596e7a641fe3e3e963c39aa8002428e4927abac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "澤枯無魚，山童難株。長女嫉妒，使身虛空。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3fcf8a18dabee770ec5d7b07eb88468144d02ba98eeb3c37eab592cea886a50f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9763a395ce5b87a436a2975d9ca34330f5b5518b513da147707d3ee1d6bef14d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "天門冬虛，晉季為災。膉暌默蒼，秦伯受殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96e894ea820d32a6dd24f1d07d19a01b86c5e037be0b8ff531701987069be9c5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd3b4e04f573ca9b2f500cf3615375967bdd7fcb6f6980abc5b69454ed859565"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "褰衣涉河，水深漬衣。賴幸舟子，濟脫無他。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9361d25345fb39dfc8f61527240f09c8692048238852f7f532dec7aa14cf0923",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:745d7f39b99e033a46ca6233b47b023e6cee24a185e62d7c4d62d1a04b388524"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "推車上山，高仰重難。終日至暮，不見阜顛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c25e1159319a67e39f173df5c67cbda050681f653a28d8f82b48424b126db764",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32057f308b295ec3e6b071e75481f4c60b93eb67d76ef0db3a42595491f05c93"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "鼎易其耳，熱不可舉。大路壅塞，旅人辛苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11a5935c51a9e96ee2437dc36b7c5b3615d5feedc9e209219fa27240eac59bee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:301238d0d3f3301ad9ed209cc83e939c3ec65598a859bc83fcf3f359d6a46262"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "四亂不安，東西為患。退身止足，無出邦域。乃得完全，賴其生福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e729d9989f7ce3191aaa4a5b6b147d062cae3da121c40b2dcacf74270f560a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94f5c4090d6f0a0add5c851f6595cd56af8db3359e67ff0f0ff40648cdd99719"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "班馬還師，以息勞疲。役夫嘉喜，入戶見妻。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42f5cd38301665f8cdebac5e2c23bcab83db697fcec526bea344f1598570ee21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f1c16fb5df12d08f975dc6f7934abc2d5dfd627c93027840856ae9dc8f72d4e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 20,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "積德不怠，遇生逢時。載善（一作喜）渭陽，身受榮光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e520278e6c5cb8fd862122782f165fbff4ce40e73e3ea04479ec5972fea8d55",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:85c52bdc0a0207ebf1d5d4722d25f1ead419ada35dea544c014a26c8469b5de4"
    }
  ]
}
